WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:04.980
The best wonderland in the whole wide world.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:08.950
That's where I thought I was going.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:11.540
Kasumi-san! Your movements need to be bigger!

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:13.540
I'm not feeling your passion!

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.260
Setsuna-chan, let's take a little break.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:19.010
It's never good to do too much at once.

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.930
We don't have time for this!

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:23.150
You all love school idols, right?

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.730
You want to be one, right?

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:30.030
We won't be able to fully express our love
to the fans with a performance like this!

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.710
But!

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:37.630
This isn't cute at all!

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:46.190
May I help you, Karin Asaka-san,
a third-year taking the life design course?

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:51.030
I guess it's really true that
you know all of the students' names.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:55.250
Then do you know about
Setsuna Yuki-san as well?

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.170
Yes.

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:59.090
I'm interested in school idols...

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:03.730
But no one seems to have any idea
what course she's taking or what class she's in.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:08.900
After some discussion with Yuki-san,
the School Idol Club was disbanded.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:13.450
I don't think she'll meet with you
to discuss school idols.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:15.750
I see.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.340
That's too bad.

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:22.470
Now to put my plan into motion!

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:25.560
--Is that all you--
--Eek! A cat!

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:28.320
A cat?

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:36.170
Hold it!

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:49.690
Sneaky sneak!

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:53.950
Yes! Looks like no one's here.

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:03.350
What do you think you're doing?

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:12.450
You're already back?!

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:16.290
But I got what I came for! Farewell!

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:19.000
Hold it!

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:22.470
Pbbt!

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.350
Honestly...

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.840
That was a huge success!

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:15.360
O-Our club room...

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:27.590
General curriculum first-year
Kasumi Nakasu-san.

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:29.720
I'm sure you know

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:31.890
what I'd like to say to you.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:37.610
D'oh.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:42.160
That mean ol' student council president!

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.580
She is pretty scary.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:47.630
But you shouldn't have snuck into
the student council office.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:54.440
I guess our club room really is gone.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:57.740
This just means that it's
do or die now, Shizuko!

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:01.950
Don't let the president oppress us like this!

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:03.920
Yeah!

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:06.670
I understand how you feel, but...

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:08.130
Right?!

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.560
Have you talked to Setsuna-san about this?

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:14.230
Of course not!

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.650
I've never seen her outside
of our club anyway.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.030
That's true...

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:20.620
Let's go, Shizuku.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.080
Oh, right.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:25.710
Sorry, I have to go to Drama Club practice.

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:27.000
I'll contact you later.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.710
Hey!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.650
Shizuko is just so insensitive!

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:41.110
And I haven't been able to get a hold of
Emma-senpai or Kanata-senpai!

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.740
At this rate,

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:47.460
I'm just going to have to become
the president and continue the club!

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:51.890
I'm just going to create a Kasumi Wonderland
overflowing with cuteness!

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:55.690
I wonder how you become a school idol.

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:57.690
Well, since "school" is in the name,

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:00.190
you probably have to join
a club at school to become one.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:02.660
You there!

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:06.750
Are you two interested in school idols?!

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:18.770
I'm Kasumi Nakasu, AKA, Kasumin,
the second president of the School Idol Club!

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.780
The School Idol Club?

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:22.740
I'm Yu Takasaki!

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.700
I'm Ayumu Uehara.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:27.460
But didn't the club disband?

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:31.420
The club will continue on forever
as long as you believe!

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:35.220
Since we're friends now, here you go.

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:36.520
--Are you sure?
--Yes!

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:38.020
Let's eat!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:43.070
It's so good!

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:44.830
Did you get these from that one shop?

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:48.750
Tsk, tsk, tsk. I made those myself!

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:51.250
Wow, no wonder you're a school idol.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:53.550
You're so cute and you can cook!

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:56.350
Huh? Cute?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:07:02.490
Oh, stop! I mean, there's no denying
that I'm cute, but...

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:05.320
You've got a good eye, Yu-senpai!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.790
Huh? You think so?

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:10.210
Anyone can see that you're cute.

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:12.340
Really?!

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:18.890
Then will you two become school idols
along with adorable little Kasumin?

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.810
Do you think we can?

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.700
Sure you can! Believe me!

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:30.040
I'm going to make the cutest
School Idol Club ever!

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:33.300
Cute...

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.260
Maybe I will do it then.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:37.720
So you'll join!

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:41.400
Oh, by the way, I'm not looking
to become an idol.

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:43.360
I just wanted to support Ayumu.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:47.070
So you're going to be her personal manager?

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:48.160
Um, maybe?

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:49.330
That's not fair!

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:52.340
--Then you should support me, too!
--Huh?

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:56.260
I have seniority when it
comes to being a school idol!

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:59.220
Meaning you should totally
listen to the president!

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:00.730
All right, Nakasu-san.

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:03.610
Come on! Don't be such a stranger!

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:05.740
Then I guess we should call you "Kasukasu"!

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:07.780
No, not Kasukasu! It's Kasumin!

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:10.370
Well, your name is Kasumi Nakasu,
so I thought Kasukasu was fitting.

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:13.340
Ugh, don't say it twice!

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:17.840
I keep telling you my name is Kasumin,
so please just call me that!

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:19.770
Oh, so that's why you kept repeating it...

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:23.400
We're going to begin
club activities immediately!

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:25.610
Follow me!

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:30.580
I did it!

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:33.840
This is our club?

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:36.340
Let's go somewhere else.

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:46.820
This spot won't work either.

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:49.200
Why are we staying off school grounds?

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:52.750
The student council has it out
for poor little Kasumin,

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:55.920
so it's hard to do club activities at school.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.180
Hey, I know a place!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.810
Wow, there's so much room!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.320
We shouldn't be able to bother anyone here.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.320
What do you think?

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:10.410
It's perfect! Let's use this place.

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:15.840
There. Ta-da!

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.720
Wait, this name plate...

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:22.220
I took it back from
the mean ol' student council!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.940
Without permission.

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:26.360
So that's why they have it out for you.

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:28.030
All's well that ends well!

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:33.580
This is going to be the Nijigasaki School
Idol Club's club room for a while.

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:39.380
We'll gradually start singing and dancing
lessons, so first, let's get more members.

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:41.350
Wait, why are we starting from there?

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:45.940
The more members we have,
the more it'll bring out my cuteness!

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:50.610
Anyway, if we're going
to get new members fast,

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:52.240
this is the best option!

00:09:55.750 --> 00:10:00.340
Hi, hi! It's me, everyone's
favorite idol, Kasumin!

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:06.980
I'm now Nijigasaki High School's
School Idol Club President,

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:10.860
but I'm not sure if I can
handle such a big role!

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:14.870
But I'm going to do my best to become

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:20.170
the cutest school idol
in all of Japan for all of you!

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:23.720
Huh?

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:29.940
Wow! That's the first time I ever saw
a school idol's intro in person!

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.860
You totally grabbed my heart, Kasumi-chan!

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:32.860
What?!

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:37.540
I knew you had excellent taste, Yu-senpai.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:41.670
We're going to upload this to a streaming site
and try to get more members.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.890
You're up next, Ayumu-senpai!

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:46.430
Just do something like what I just did!

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:50.400
Huh? What?! No, no, no, I can't!
It's too embarrassing!

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:52.150
Why is it embarrassing?!

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:55.620
Introducing yourself is the first step
to becoming a school idol!

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.620
Your eyes are a bit scary, Kasumi-chan...

00:10:57.620 --> 00:11:00.750
Don't worry! You're not as cute as me,

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:03.590
but you've still got plenty
of potential, Ayumu-senpai!

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:06.100
Now let's do this thing!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.570
Um... I'm Ayumu Uehara,

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:15.410
and I'm a second-year at Nijigasaki
High School taking the general curriculum.

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:18.080
U-Um, I-I...

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:20.500
You need to speak up!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.000
S-Sorry!

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.470
I want to be a school idol!

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:28.640
That's too loud! Think about all of the fans!

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:30.150
Fans?

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:33.440
You fail.

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:34.860
Aw...

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:37.160
I-I can't do this out of the blue.

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:39.580
Very well, then.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:43.170
Put both of your hands above your head.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:44.130
Like this?

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:46.140
And try adding "bun"
to the end of your sentences.

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:46.970
Bun?!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.430
--Bun!
--Bun, bun!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:50.270
What?!

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:51.650
Go on.

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:55.950
Go on!

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:06.050
I'm...

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:07.430
I'm Ayumu, bun...

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:09.430
You need to be louder! One more time!

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:10.430
I'm Ayumu, bun!

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:12.060
You need to actually believe you're a bunny!

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:13.070
I'm a bunny, bun, bun!

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:14.860
I need more feeling in those buns!

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:18.240
Bun!

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:24.250
We're going to be uploading videos this weekend,
so please practice on your own until then.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:26.380
Cute is scary... Cute is scary...

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:28.680
--It's a lot of work being cute.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:30.730
--Well, it's essential to being an idol.
--Cute is scary...

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:33.560
But with Setsuna-chan,
I'm not sure if I'd call her cute.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:36.150
I'd describe her as cool.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.530
You know Setsuna-senpai?

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:42.330
Yeah, though I only saw her once from afar.

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:46.630
This has been bugging me,
but why did the club disband?

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:52.890
It's actually all Setsuna-senpai's fault...

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:57.070
When we first formed our group,
everything was going pretty well.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:59.990
But once we decided to
do our debut performance,

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:02.540
she started getting really snippy.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:05.500
She kept saying that we
won't be able to fully express

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:09.180
our love to the fans with
a performance like this and stuff.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:14.940
And that's why I got
really angry, and then...

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:18.280
We went on hiatus...

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:22.370
It sounds like both you and Setsuna-chan

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:24.670
had something you wanted
to deliver to the fans.

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.460
Of course!

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:31.760
Nothing is more important to a school idol
than everyone who supports them.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:36.110
In order to be the cutest idols ever...

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:39.950
What exactly is cute?
Why is being cute so hard?

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.410
--Jeez.
--Cute is...

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:46.000
At this rate, the fans won't see
how cute you are!

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.730
Kasumi-chan?

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.480
Wait...

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:02.030
Am I doing the exact same thing?

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:13.970
This isn't cute at all!
Who cares about passion?

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:17.610
I want to concentrate on being cute!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.980
"Delicious Cat Chow"
Is that good?

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:37.940
"Delicious Cat Chow"

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:40.610
You don't need to go help
out the sports clubs?

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:42.320
I'll go in a bit.

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:44.700
How'd it go with your family?

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:48.040
It's a no go. They do
run a restaurant after all.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:51.340
Our condo doesn't allow pets either.

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:59.310
That's the person who took Hanpen yesterday.

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:03.990
And I was working so hard so that
everyone could come back someday...

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:10.800
What am I supposed to do?
I just don't know anymore...

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.260
Are you troubled?

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.430
When did you get here?

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:19.350
Well, something seemed off, so...

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:21.150
Where's Ayumu-senpai?

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:24.320
She said she was gonna practice a bit more
before heading to the park.

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:31.550
Yu-senpai!

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:45.740
I'm the newbie school idol Ayumu, bun!

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:50.670
I'm a scaredy buns
so I cry when I'm lonely, bun!

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.040
I hope you'll--

00:15:57.640 --> 00:16:02.190
Th-This is just... Um...
I was practicing to be a s-s-s...

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:04.070
A school idol?

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:07.330
Oh, I see.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:11.460
I'm sorry for seeing
your super cute moment there.

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:14.380
But are those words from your heart?

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:15.550
Huh?

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:19.730
You should probably think about
who you're speaking to a bit more.

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:25.490
I totally understand that,
but it's not like I have any fans right now...

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:34.130
But I do have someone who supports me.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:38.970
I'm done meddling now. Just do your best.

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:46.820
There's something that's
really important to me.

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:50.540
That's why I wanted to become a school idol.

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:52.330
I mean...

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:54.880
I'm sure everyone feels that way.

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:57.680
I want to do what I want to do.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:17:02.600
But I don't want to force others
to do what I want to do.

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:07.530
And yet, I ended up
doing that to Ayumu-senpai...

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:09.120
Hm...

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:13.580
So that basically means all of you
had different goals in mind, right?

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:16.800
It's inevitable that you'd fight over that.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.050
But it can't be inevitable!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:24.440
At this rate, the club's
just not going to work out!

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:26.940
You're really cute when
you're troubled, Kasumin.

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:31.830
--Don't tease me right now, Senpai!

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:34.500
--I'm not!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.500
I'm so sorry that I'm late!

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:38.050
Ayumu.

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:41.470
Um...

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:43.940
About my introduction...

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:46.480
Can we film it right now?

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:49.910
S-Sure!

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.630
Okay, here I go.

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:56.960
Go for it.

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.430
I'm Ayumu Uehara.
I'm a second-year at Nijigasaki High

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:03.810
taking the general curriculum.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:06.860
I joined the School Idol Club
because I wanted to

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:10.490
express what I love and what I want to do!

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:12.870
There's still a lot I can't do,

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:17.880
but I hope you'll support me
every step of the way as I do my best.

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:19.380
Thank you!

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:26.730
How was that?

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:31.990
That was so cute! You
totally grabbed my heart!

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:33.620
Ahem.

00:18:33.620 --> 00:18:37.750
That wasn't exactly what I had in mind...

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:39.550
But it was cute, so you pass.

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:42.800
Really?! Thank goodness!

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:48.400
I think it's okay if you all
have different goals.

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:52.700
I don't know how to put it exactly...

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:59.040
But I think there's a way for everyone
to be the best that they can be!

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:01.210
Really?

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:03.640
Well, let's find out!

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:06.730
Not to mention, isn't that more fun?

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:16.500
It is, and it's cute, too!

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.210
Right?

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:22.920
Just watch, Senpai!

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:32.610
A place where all kinds of cute
and cool people can be together.

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:35.620
If we can actually create
a place like that...

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:38.960
Just remember, Ayumu-senpai!

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:41.670
No matter how wonderful our club is,

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:46.430
Kasumin will always be the cutest
in the whole wide world!

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:26.760
--A place where all kinds of cute
and cool people can be together...

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:29.800
--That was amazing, Kasumi-chan!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:33.230
If we can actually create
a place like that...

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:38.110
That'll definitely be the best wonderland
in the whole wide world!

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:57.780
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:21:57.780 --> 00:22:01.660
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:08.510
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:11.300
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:15.230
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:21.870
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:22:21.870 --> 00:22:24.160
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:22:24.160 --> 00:22:28.630
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:36.730
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:22:37.650 --> 00:22:41.110
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:44.200
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:48.710
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:22:48.710 --> 00:22:51.340
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:54.600
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:57.730
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:22:57.730 --> 00:23:03.030
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:23:03.030 --> 00:23:07.250
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>

00:23:10.090 --> 00:23:10.510
"Student Directory"

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:13.050
Here's the student directory back.

00:23:13.050 --> 00:23:15.890
Sorry for borrowing it without permission.

00:23:15.890 --> 00:23:21.030
I couldn't seem to find Setsuna Yuki
listed on there anywhere.

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:24.280
Considering Setsuna doesn't exist,

00:23:24.280 --> 00:23:28.620
how were you two able to
discuss disbanding the club?

00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:33.130
Would you mind explaining that,
Setsuna Yuki-san?

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.350
Next time, "Shouting Your Love."
